{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "CoA Legendary Items: native equip tooltips",
  "contract": [
    "Requires CoALegendaryItems.Enable=1 and CoA.SendDisplayPatches=1.",
    "Widow Queen Seal variants for required levels 1, 22 and 60 advertise 13, 34 and 72 spell power.",
    "Single and bulk item responses attach a native equip spell and omit the power from flavor text.",
    "Login omits unowned tooltip spells. Queries and acquisition stream only associated spells once per session.",
    "Relog streams only owned variants. The capacity placeholder defers its tooltip until the item is queried.",
    "Client spell patches contain the exact condition and amount with no executable effects.",
    "Equipping the level-22 seal grants only the conditional power aura at or below 35% health.",
    "Captured socketless packets establish construction, not client rendering or network delivery."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
